Z||000016||fiero56||12-21-1999||10:30 PM||||Looks like I gave out some bad advice here. Good thing Gokart didn't listen to me. I read the post as though Gokart were talking about the disconnected pipes on the firewall side, not the trunk side(even though he specifically says trunk side). I don't have the pipes on the trunk side. Why did GM take the fan off on later years? Did it really help that much to have it?||||reg||1
Z||000017||Monkeyman||12-21-1999||10:50 PM||||fiero56--Looks like you have 2 choices.  You can borrow some of dogtireds medication, you can borrow some of mine, or you can purchase what's left of my "Hooked on Phonics".  (Barely used, I couldn't understand it.)<P>Seriously, (can I really be serious? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">) even if the fan didn't help much, it might be better than nothing at all as long as it's not hurting anything.  <P>Gokart--If you can get by with out driving your Fiero for a little while, why not send your dogbone out to be chromed?||||reg||1
